{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9DaGluZXNlLU1vdmllcy9Hb2xkZW4lMjBTd2FsbG93JTIwJTI4MTk2OCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Golden Swallow","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/vaLjoOIJhJD8SdLS70g5dGzB8oR.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/40aUtLYR6zZj4Q7OXoRtBbgGYer.jpg","description":"Golden Swallow revolves around the further adventures of its title character. This time around, she is forced into violence when a figure from her mysterious past goes on a killing rampage while leaving evidence that holds her responsible. Golden Swallow also makes room for a love triangle involving a mad, but righteous, swordsman named Silver Roc and a gentle warrior named Golden Whip. The three team up to conquer the evil forces of the martial world, but their joint venture only lasts so long, due to the two men's egos. Ultimately, a duel to the death is planned between them, leaving Golden Swallow caught between two men, both of whom she admires.","releaseInfo":"1968","genres":["Action","Adventure","Romance","Others"],"imdbRating":"6.3","runtime":"104 min","cast":["Jimmy Wang Yu","Cheng Pei-pei","Lo Lieh","Chiu Sam-Yin","Wu Ma","Yang Chi-Ching","Hoh Ban","Liu Gang"],"director":["Chang Cheh"],"released":"1968-04-03T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Mistress of Kung Fu and the Martial Arts!","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Jimmy Wang Yu","character":"Silver Roc Xiao Pang","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hiLq2L8EPX94Ojl1W0lca3NeYLb.jpg"},{"name":"Cheng Pei-pei","character":"Golden Swallow Xie Ru Yan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2l8UII2blRKYUNlPZloTugku2zD.jpg"},{"name":"Lo Lieh","character":"Golden Whip Han Tao","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8Cfd8ZEWjDyCktjVysj9kt0vUnE.jpg"},{"name":"Chiu Sam-Yin","character":"Mei Niang","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/d3pVp0rw9jmEDeZffyOFa0N0Szq.jpg"},{"name":"Wu Ma","character":"Flying Fox Hu Zhen","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fIwXNGnX